# CAD only

This store is **CAD-only**. Do not introduce USD unless the user explicitly asks.

## Do

- Price, charge, refund (new), format, report, and email in **CAD**
- `formatPrice` always renders CAD (`en-CA`)
- New Stripe PaymentIntents / Terminal charges use the CAD account only
- When saving catalog/shipping prices, write the CAD amount into both `price_cad` and `price_usd` (legacy mirror columns)

## Do not

- Add USD prices, USD inputs, USD checkout, dual-currency UI, or "USD revenue" KPIs
- Pick price by country (`price_usd` vs `price_cad`) — always use CAD
- Document or seed a second selling currency
- Rename or drop `price_usd` / `cost_usd` DB columns (legacy mirrors + historical rows)

## Internal exception (not UI)

`StripeAccountCurrency` may include `"USD"` only to verify **old** Stripe webhook signatures / refund historical USD PaymentIntents. Never surface that in storefront or admin copy.
